{"itemid":"919260","languages":{"english":{"app[content][about]":"[p]Boot up, log on and prepare for intense double-clicking action.[\/p][p][img src=&quot;{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}\/extras\/doubleclickfull-optimize&quot;][\/img]In Antivirus Survivors 2003 Professional, double-click through folders as you dodge voids, fight viruses, evade spam pop-ups, and defeat bosses. Search for XP and keys by exploring the folders and opening files, completing tasks and policies for bonuses. Develop your build through upgrades and plugins, and unlock new weapons and styles of gameplay.[\/p][p]With intense rogue-like action and a deep love for early 2000s computer operating systems, this is a blast of pure Y2K nostalgia served in roughly 30-40 minute runs.[\/p][p][img src=&quot;{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}\/extras\/survivefull-optimize&quot;][\/img][\/p][p][b]The full game includes:[\/b][\/p][list][*][p][b]24 Weapons[\/b] - Pinball, Solitaire, Mines, Firewall, and more inspired by the 2000’s computing era.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]50 Drivers[\/b] - Transform how a weapon usually works with bespoke upgrades.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]33 File Types[\/b] - Double-click on your favourite file types for rewards - LemWire, BigWave, Defrag and more.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]62 Plugins[\/b] - Open keygens and install plugins to greatly modify weapons and player stats.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]18 Meta Upgrades[\/b] - Choose wisely to shape your path through meta progression.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]5 Difficulty Levels[\/b] - Five protocol folders with escalating risks and rewards.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]15 Policies[\/b] - Unique challenges to experience the game in more difficult and interesting ways.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]18 Player Stats [\/b]- Create unique builds when upgrading damage, speed, luck and more.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]81 Wallpapers and 8 Themes[\/b] - Unlockable cosmetics to customise your desktop.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]6 Bosses and Mini Bosses[\/b] - Supercharged enemies and powerful bosses to defeat.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]200+ Tasks [\/b]- Complete extra tasks to unlock new Files, Weapons, Plugins and more![\/p][\/*][\/list][p][img src=&quot;{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}\/extras\/upgradefuull-optimize&quot;][\/img][\/p][p]Double-Click, Unzip, Download, Upgrade, Survive.[\/p]","app[content][short_description]":"The family computer is infected again and it’s your job to fend off waves of viruses and adware foes with an arsenal of nostalgic Y2K-inspired weapons. Antivirus Survivors 2003 Professional is a survivor-like auto-shooter filled with nods to the days when computers were actually fun.","app[content][sysreqs][mac][min][osversion]":"macOS 12","app[content][sysreqs][mac][min][processor]":"Apple M1 or 2.0 GHz Intel","app[content][sysreqs][mac][min][graphics]":"512 MB VRAM","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"Windows 10","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"2.0 GHz","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics]":"512 MB VRAM","app[content][sysreqs][linux][min][osversion]":"SteamOS or any modern Linux Distro","app[content][sysreqs][linux][min][processor]":"2.0 GHz","app[content][sysreqs][linux][min][graphics]":"512 MB VRAM"},"french":{"app[content][about]":"","app[content][short_description]":"","app[content][sysreqs][mac][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][mac][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][mac][min][graphics]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics]":"","app[content][sysreqs][linux][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][linux][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][linux][min][graphics]":""},"italian":{"app[content][about]":"","app[content][short_description]":"","app[content][sysreqs][mac][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][mac][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][mac][min][graphics]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics